<html><head><title>Researchers role</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><p><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Transdisciplinary education is derived from transdisciplinary research, where scientists from various disciplines collaborate with non-academic partners on a 'wicked problem' (OECD, 2020). The research perspective is crucial in transdisciplinary education to guide and ensure the research-driven approach in the project, such as problem identification and the integration of types of knowledge and methods (Klein, 2014).</span><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p lang="EN-US" style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif; font-weight: bold">References:</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Klein, J.T. (2017). Typologies of Interdisciplinarity: The Boundary Work of Definition. In: </span><span style="margin: 0px">Frodeman</span><span style="margin: 0px">, R. (ed.), </span></span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; font-style: italic; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">The Oxford Handbook of Interdisciplinarity, </span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">2nd edition (pp. 21-34</span><span style="margin: 0px">).Oxford</span><span style="margin: 0px"> Handbooks. </span></span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1093/oxfordhb/9780198733522.013.3" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="color: inherit; margin: 0px"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(70, 120, 134); font-size: 12px; text-decoration-line: underline; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">https://doi.org/10.1093/oxfordhb/9780198733522.013.3</span></span></a><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20.5042px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div><p><span style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"></span></p><div style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px"><p style="margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 10.6667px; margin-left: 0px; color: windowtext"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">OECD (2021), Embedding Values and Attitudes in Curriculum: Shaping a Better Future, OECD Publishing, Paris, </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1787/aee2adcd-en" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="color: inherit; margin: 0px"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; color: rgb(70, 120, 134); font-size: 12px; text-decoration-line: underline; line-height: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">https://doi.org/10.1787/aee2adcd-en</span></span></a><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 12px; line-height: 16px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></p></div></body></html>